{"4537080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drift Tank", "steam_appid": 4537080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537080/extras/f3d8497604ad8996ec2f3e1bf14fe8cb.avif?t=1776089132\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift in tank and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537080/extras/eadc34ce853524d58536078b25815a5d.avif?t=1776089132\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Drift Tank</strong> is a casual, freeform driving game where you can slide, drift, and crash around without strict objectives. Explore 10 unique maps, master your tank’s handling, and enjoy endless chaotic fun. Experiment with different maneuvers, find your favorite map, and embrace the thrill of pure, unrestricted driving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Fun Maps, from tight arenas to wide open spaces. Easy to Pick Up, with simple controls for instant fun. Physics-based Drifting, allowing you to slide around corners and smash through obstacles. Casual Gameplay, offering no stress or points, just pure enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>It's not realistic simulator</u></i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537080/extras/f3d8497604ad8996ec2f3e1bf14fe8cb.avif?t=1776089132\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift in tank and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai